BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 197.0 Td (voltage drop.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 183.0 Td (1. R_total = 4 + 6 = 10 ohms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 169.0 Td (2. I = V/R_total = 20/10 = 2 A.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 155.0 Td (3. The drops are 2 x 4 = 8 V and 2 x 6 = 12 V.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 141.0 Td (Answer: Current = 2 A; voltage drops = 8 V and 12 V.) Tj ET
